      "title": "How to Use",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "This example workflow demonstrates Batch Text node.\n\n1. Enter multiple prompts (one per line) in the Batch Text node\n2. Connect to your CLIP Text Encode\n3. Complete your workflow as normal (add checkpoint, sampler, VAE, etc.)\n4. Queue the workflow - it will generate one image per prompt automatically!\n\nThe node will output a list of prompts that ComfyUI processes in batch mode."
